    <tr><td>Suction Power</td><td>700–1000 m³/hr for Indian cooking</td><td>600 m³/hr is the minimum for a gas hob; less = inadequate for heavy cooking</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Filter Type</td><td>Baffle filter (aluminium) — not mesh</td><td>Baffle filters trap grease and are dishwasher-safe; mesh filters clog fast and are hard to clean</td></tr>
